        "created_at": "2016-07-16T23:25:52.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just curious, all Wager Master's Condition cards are indestructible as stated on both side of his character cards. All Drug cards are indestructible as state on the Drug cards.</p><p>For consistency, why not write the indestructible text of Drug cards on Spite's character cards instead? Are there any scenarios where the different placement of the indestructible text comes into play?</p>",
